'''Doug''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{Zone|Carnival}} during the [[Carnival|{{Yellow|Carnival}}]] event. They have a shop menu where players can spend {{Item|Carnival Tokens}} to obtain [[Carnival Mask]]s and buffs to the [[Fishing Festival]], [[Mining Fiesta]], [[Mythological Ritual]], [[Spooky Festival]], [[Season of Jerry]], and [[Harvest Feast]] events.

== Interface ==
{{/UI}}

