== Trivia ==
*'''Doug''''s Dialogue is a reference to the popular quotes from Morshu from the game [[w:Link: The Faces of Evil|Link: The Faces of Evil]].
*'''Doug''' was named after Hypixel player SuperDuggy117, who wrote lots of dialogue for the Better Mayors update, including this one.
*As of '''0.27''', {{Carnival Tokens|27,050}} are needed to purchase all items and perks from {{NPCSprite|Doug}} :
**{{Yellow|Masks Shop}} requires {{Carnival Tokens|7,250}}. If solely [[Chantelle|Carnival Goals]] were used to gain {{Carnival Tokens}}, it would take {{Green|6}} [[Carnival]]s to purchase all its items.
**Each of the {{Yellow|Event Shops}} requires {{Carnival Tokens|3,300}} to max, resulting in a total of {{Carnival Tokens|19,800}}. If solely [[Chantelle|Carnival Goals]] were used to gain {{Carnival Tokens}}, it would take {{Green|17}} [[Carnival]]s to purchase all its perks.

